  "diagnosis": "Two blinded GLM portfolio routes per view on six revisited learn tasks and six new independent learn sources. Only the issue and, in the intervention, bounded public test AST shapes and filenames. A cohort meets the routing target if the child is selected on all four exception judgments, parent choices on config reach at least three of four and at least the concurrent issue count, false applications on controls are at most one of four and no more than issue, and invalid decisions do not increase. Report both cohorts. Always run the one frozen intervention on dev regardless of this mechanism check. No choosing from alternative candidates or interim stopping.",
  "comparison": "All seven dev cases five times in four fresh arms. Parent is the original parent/issue. Issue portfolio directly isolates the routing change at fixed skill content. All eight ancestral supports three times in three arms. Keep all independent solver outcomes. Within each complete arm rotation every arm occupies each position once. At most one routing call plus fifteen solver actions per arm; bare has the identical solver allowance. No content or routing changes during evaluation.",
  "gate": "At least two independent object sources each with >=3 of 5 actual parent-fail/portfolio-pass pairs using the child with a different first solver request. Count ties in denominator. Across ALL dev and support tasks, require zero negative changed-input net for each task and no raw loss majority (3/5 on dev, 2/3 on support). Apply the full gate against original parent and current no-skill deployment. Same-input wins and losses cancel from attribution symmetrically, including when both retain the parent or both skip; they remain in raw observations and the majority-loss veto. Missing, duplicated, infrastructure-error or unsettled evidence cannot authorize publication. The prior-portfolio comparison is a separate diagnostic.",
  "test": "After actual gated publication only: 30 original untouched configuration tasks, one matched bare/frozen-portfolio pair each, no learning. Scalar, layers and batch fixed order; family and cumulative paired repair gain. Publish a diversity curve only with all 30 observed pairs. Engineering release criterion, no population-level significance claim."
